abstract: >
  A computational analysis of the PPE18 (Rv1196) protein across selected
  Mycobacterium tuberculosis lineages, integrating comparative genomics,
  protein sequence analysis, multiple sequence alignment, phylogenetic
  reconstruction, three-dimensional structural modelling, and structural
  validation.

